sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor K as Kunde or Gaest
    participant CM as Cart/Index (OnPostAdd)
    participant CA as ICatalog
    participant CS as ICartStore
    participant DB as MarsvinDb or Session

    Note over K,CS: No login needed. ICartStore is chosen per request in Program.cs:<br/>SqlCartStore (dbo.CartItems) when signed in, SessionCartStore for a guest.

    K->>CM: POST /Cart?handler=Add (productId, quantity, returnUrl,<br/>confirmNotAlone, companionNote)

    alt signed in as Employee or Admin
        CM-->>K: error message, back to returnUrl
        Note over CM: The pages already hide the button from staff -<br/>checked again here, since anyone can POST directly.
    else guest or Customer
        CM->>CA: FindAnimal(productId)
        CA-->>CM: Animal or null

        alt it is an animal
            CM->>CM: animal.CanBeAddedToCart(1)
            Note over CM: Status = Available and at least 4 weeks old.
            alt cannot be added
                CM-->>K: error toast, back to returnUrl
            else unbonded animal without confirmNotAlone and companionNote
                CM-->>K: error: only sold alone if it will not live alone
                Note over CM: Checked server-side - a checkbox in the HTML<br/>is exactly as trustworthy as no checkbox.
            else ok
                CM->>CS: AddOrIncrement(userId, productId, 1)
                opt animal has BondedWithId and partner not already in the cart
                    CM->>CA: FindAnimal(partnerId)
                    CM->>CS: AddOrIncrement(userId, partnerId, 1)
                    Note over CM,CS: The pair moves in together - both are added.
                end
                CM-->>K: back to returnUrl, with a box asking:<br/>go to the cart, or keep shopping?
            end
        else it is an accessory
            CM->>CA: Accessories lookup by productId
            alt not found or quantity < 1
                CM-->>K: error toast
            else found
                CM->>CS: GetLines(userId)
                CM->>CM: CanBeAddedToCart(quantityInCart + quantity)
                alt more than StockQuantity
                    CM-->>K: "Der er ikke N styk tilbage"
                else ok
                    CM->>CS: AddOrIncrement(userId, productId, quantity)
                    alt signed in
                        CS->>DB: MERGE dbo.CartItems - insert or bump Quantity
                        Note over CS,DB: UQ_CartItems_UserProduct keeps<br/>one row per user per product.
                    else guest
                        CS->>DB: session: productId + quantity only
                    end
                    CM-->>K: back to returnUrl, with a box asking:<br/>go to the cart, or keep shopping?
                end
            end
        end
    end

    Note over CM,DB: The redirect target is only used if IsSafeLocalUrl(returnUrl)<br/>(one leading slash, no //host) - otherwise /Cart.<br/>Either cart stores only productId and quantity - prices are read live<br/>and re-read inside the checkout transaction.<br/>A guest's cart is merged into the account's cart at login.
